@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness (no dependencies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness (checks PostgreSQL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### System info (standard response envelope)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/info
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only) — interactive UI at {{baseUrl}}/scalar
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
